The following parts are original to this project:

  src/            Rust implementation (standard library only, no third-party crates)
  build.rs        build-time gzip packaging of the front-end assets
  tests/          unit and integration tests
  tools/          icon generation helper
  ui/             front-end (HTML/CSS/JS/SVG/ICO) embedded into the binary

The produced binaries link a C runtime statically. Binary distributions should
state the linking mode and, for glibc static builds, provide the means to relink
(see the license section of README.md).
